# Flutter Tech Stack

- Always use Flutter with Material 3
- State management: Riverpod
- Local storage: shared_preferences
- In-app purchases: RevenueCat (`purchases_flutter`)
- Notifications: flutter_local_notifications
- Prefer simple, clean architecture — no extra layers unless needed

When creating a new app, reuse the same patterns as previous apps in this workspace.
